# Netlify test environment rules.
# 1) Proxy API calls same-origin so the browser never does a cross-origin request
#    to api.lexamplify.com (which does not CORS-allow netlify.app origins). Requires
#    the bundle to call a RELATIVE /api base (VITE_API_BASE_URL empty for this build).
/api/*  https://api.lexamplify.com/api/:splat  200

# 2) SPA fallback: serve index.html for client-side routes so deep links don't 404.
#    (Firebase hosting does both of these via firebase.json; this is Netlify-only.)
/*      /index.html                            200
